              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Arawuna yunamuye amaso abona umwami n’abantu biwe baza aho ari, aca arunama imbere y’umwami, ashika hasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
